  "agent summary: The primary mismatch is a latent-state offset: TAN is persistently high relative to the model (bias_z 13.331), and an independent TAN assay confirms it (disagreement_z 2.674), while VFA is not biased. A secondary influent-mapping problem is supported by the COD residual being most explanatory by high-strength-waste feed, the independent COD assay disagreement (2.1741), and charge drift (0.32343); the boundary-near fit for Y_ac is therefore not offered as a kinetic update.",
